# Secrets - real values live only in .env, never committed. .env.example ships the
# placeholder template and IS meant to be committed - do not add a broader ".env*" pattern
# here, it would also hide .env.example and frontend's .env.development (no secrets in either).
.env

# Backend (Maven/Spring Boot)
target/

# Frontend (Vite/Node)
node_modules/
dist/

# Logs
*.log

# Exploratory API response dumps kept for local reference only - not project source, not
# needed by anyone else to build/run this.
betedge/exploracion-api/
betedge/exploracion-odds-api/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Local dev-tool config (permissions, launch config) - not project source.
.claude/
